  << /ActualText (local environmental efforts\056 From organising planting days to supporting our dedicated trappers\054 Nada brought energy\054 warmth\054 and commitment to everything she did\056 Behind the scenes\054 she kept things running smoothly and provided invaluable support to our chairperson\054 Brian\056 Her ability to connect people and keep projects moving forward has left a lasting impact\056\n\nWe are incredibly grateful for Nada\031s contribution and the strong foundation she leaves behind\056 While we are sad to see her go\054 we wish her all the very best as she moves to Wellington to be closer to her sister\056 She will be greatly missed\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
